{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":9,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":302,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1896732,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":283070,"Name":"KG1990","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283070.jpg?_r=1432102786","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1432189057,"LastPoster":{"Id":279353,"Name":"JamaicaNicole","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1896732,"PostDate":1432189057,"PostContent":"I'm very new to this site and wedding planning. Hope I can find some other brides here planning t...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laquetta.gay90@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.87.37.13","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1431411918,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283070.jpg?_r=1432102786","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KG1990","Id":283070,"Name":"KG1990","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.211.129.180","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79199,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0195663b776748f4d4235a1eb12ed9b","RawContent":"I&#039;m very new to this site and wedding planning. Hope I can find some other brides here planning to get married here at Secrets Wild Orchid. I just put my deposit down for May 28th, 2016. Memorial weekend. Would love to hear from others that are planning or in process of planning their wedding ;-) \ud83d\ude01","Attachments":[],"Id":1896732,"PostDate":1432189057,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm very new to this site and wedding planning. Hope I can find some other brides here planning to get married here at Secrets Wild Orchid. I just put my deposit down for May 28th, 2016. Memorial weekend. Would love to hear from others that are planning or in process of planning their wedding ;-) \ud83d\ude01\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laquetta.gay90@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.87.37.13","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1431411918,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283070.jpg?_r=1432102786","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KG1990","Id":283070,"Name":"KG1990","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79199,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6d37d6120a67ad06854e960549455d0e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;welcome to BDW! &amp;nbsp;We were just at Secrets Wild Orchid in May. &amp;nbsp;A great resort and do not miss the jerk chicken cart. &amp;nbsp;AMAZING!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You may want to contact TA Babs. &amp;nbsp;She has booked many weddings there and has some great exclusive promos.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can contact us via the link in my signature :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896771,"PostDate":1432223878,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>welcome to BDW! \u00a0We were just at Secrets Wild Orchid in May. \u00a0A great resort and do not miss the jerk chicken cart. \u00a0AMAZING!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You may want to contact TA Babs. \u00a0She has booked many weddings there and has some great exclusive promos.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can contact us via the link in my signature <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"100.11.189.52","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79199,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26c1b8d7f963ddbb3dfa42ae648ce77d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"KG1990\"]......Congratulations and welcome to the site.&amp;nbsp; You will find great info here.&amp;nbsp; Secrets was my first choice of resorts, however, we invited guests with children.&amp;nbsp; Later on found out that the guests with children would not be attending and my date was booked at Secrets!!!&amp;nbsp; :angry:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;However, I have toured Secrets twice and it is a lovely resort.&amp;nbsp; You will have a beautiful wedding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Again, congrats!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896795,"PostDate":1432236932,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283070\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283070-kg1990\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KG1990<\/span><\/a>......Congratulations and welcome to the site.\u00a0 You will find great info here.\u00a0 Secrets was my first choice of resorts, however, we invited guests with children.\u00a0 Later on found out that the guests with children would not be attending and my date was booked at Secrets!!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/angry.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':angry:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>However, I have toured Secrets twice and it is a lovely resort.\u00a0 You will have a beautiful wedding.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Again, congrats!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397066522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.75.116.50","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79199,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"679b742fca9b3330a7122cc39220685e","RawContent":"TA Babs is my TA, and she has been AWESOME!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1896833,"PostDate":1432263998,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                TA Babs is my TA, and she has been AWESOME!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374614124,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.225.204.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79199,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"51f41a68b91ad94be67cd4199e3ad828","RawContent":"I am not a Secrets bride. I was at Secrets St James last week (same preperty as Wild Orchid). I saw a beach wedding that left me in happy tears. It was so beautufil. Dont miss the jerk chicken cart or the Coconut guy. Or the pool entertainmemt guy (i forget his name but you will know who he is) service was 10 stars and the Jamaicans make you feel like you are at home..they nvr say no!  Attaching pics. Hope they come through","Attachments":[],"Id":1896834,"PostDate":1432264226,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am not a Secrets bride. I was at Secrets St James last week (same preperty as Wild Orchid). I saw a beach wedding that left me in happy tears. It was so beautufil. Dont miss the jerk chicken cart or the Coconut guy. Or the pool entertainmemt guy (i forget his name but you will know who he is) service was 10 stars and the Jamaicans make you feel like you are at home..they nvr say no!  Attaching pics. Hope they come through <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1896834]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-278682-143226396935.jpg\" title=\"uploadfromtaptalk1432263945422.jpg - Size: 1.8MB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-278682-143226396935.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"uploadfromtaptalk1432263945422.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1896834]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-278682-143226400444.jpg\" title=\"uploadfromtaptalk1432263975193.jpg - Size: 3.02MB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-278682-143226400444.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"uploadfromtaptalk1432263975193.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1896834]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-278682-143226404848.jpg\" title=\"uploadfromtaptalk1432264017496.jpg - Size: 3.4MB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-278682-143226404848.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"uploadfromtaptalk1432264017496.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1896834]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-278682-143226409826.jpg\" title=\"uploadfromtaptalk1432264071823.jpg - Size: 2.4MB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-278682-143226409826.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"uploadfromtaptalk1432264071823.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keredondo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.225.204.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403646019,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278682.jpg?_r=1414954781","PhotoWidth":187,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BecomingaRiggio","Id":278682,"Name":"BecomingaRiggio","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.211.129.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79199,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45e91394b8e2a2a47e3cb13b0e0b45a1","RawContent":"Congrats to you on your wedding!...and Omg! Thank you so much for posting pics! This is very helpful! I haven&#039;t been to this resort so it&#039;s always nerve wrecking making the decision to choose a resort you&#039;ve never been to! I have heard a lot about the Jerk Chicken guy..so I&#039;m so looking forward to that for sure! Thank you so much for your pics! Certainly appreciate it! ;-) this site is great! \n@[member=\"RandL2015\"] thank you! Yes I found Babs on this site as well from another bride. I just got a quote from her a few days ago! Sounds like she has gotten great reviews and has experience with group bookings at Secrets which is great! ;-) how has your planning been so far? I&#039;m just now looking at ideas and stuff on Pinterest! There&#039;s soooo much stuff out there! Lol! #indecisive\n\nThanks for your help!","Attachments":[],"Id":1896837,"PostDate":1432267206,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats to you on your wedding!...and Omg! Thank you so much for posting pics! This is very helpful! I haven't been to this resort so it's always nerve wrecking making the decision to choose a resort you've never been to! I have heard a lot about the Jerk Chicken guy..so I'm so looking forward to that for sure! Thank you so much for your pics! Certainly appreciate it! ;-) this site is great! <br \/>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"271841\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/271841-randl2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RandL2015<\/span><\/a> thank you! Yes I found Babs on this site as well from another bride. I just got a quote from her a few days ago! Sounds like she has gotten great reviews and has experience with group bookings at Secrets which is great! ;-) how has your planning been so far? I'm just now looking at ideas and stuff on Pinterest! There's soooo much stuff out there! Lol! #indecisive<br>\nThanks for your help! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laquetta.gay90@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.87.37.13","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1431411918,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283070.jpg?_r=1432102786","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KG1990","Id":283070,"Name":"KG1990","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.101.115","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79199,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ad3457722ea51f2c1fd460c0e9e08011","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, KG1990 and Congrats on your Montego Bay wedding next May!!! as you&#039;ve already seen, there are lots of great resources here to help with your planning decisions, so well done on joining up :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at some recent Mayan Riviera beach weddings .....to ramp up your creative juices ....enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...from the&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153148788044487.1073741924.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt; Secrets Maroma Wedding Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-lga1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10981366_10153148792919487_1642057957273659754_o.jpg\" alt=\"10981366_10153148792919487_1642057957273\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...or this one from a &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153148760879487.1073741923.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Jungle Trash the Dress Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-lga1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11032149_10153148762849487_364000385808957458_o.jpg\" alt=\"11032149_10153148762849487_3640003858089\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....and here&#039;s an excerpt from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153122555899487.1073741922.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Moon Palace Wedding Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-lga1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xat1\/t31.0-8\/10845766_10153122558269487_2224816078846314465_o.jpg\" alt=\"10845766_10153122558269487_2224816078846\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans, cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896917,"PostDate":1432318818,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, KG1990 and Congrats on your Montego Bay wedding next May!!! as you've already seen, there are lots of great resources here to help with your planning decisions, so well done on joining up <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration, here are some magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at some recent Mayan Riviera beach weddings .....to ramp up your creative juices ....enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...from the<a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153148788044487.1073741924.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'> Secrets Maroma Wedding Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-lga1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10981366_10153148792919487_1642057957273659754_o.jpg\" alt=\"10981366_10153148792919487_1642057957273\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...or this one from a <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153148760879487.1073741923.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Jungle Trash the Dress Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-lga1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11032149_10153148762849487_364000385808957458_o.jpg\" alt=\"11032149_10153148762849487_3640003858089\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....and here's an excerpt from the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153122555899487.1073741922.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Moon Palace Wedding Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-lga1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xat1\/t31.0-8\/10845766_10153122558269487_2224816078846314465_o.jpg\" alt=\"10845766_10153122558269487_2224816078846\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans, cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.75.116.50","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79199,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ebc900cc549d622d935675bee996a307","RawContent":"I&#039;m on the 6 months countdown. So it is now time to get serious about my planning. Next up, ordering wedding invitations, and purchasing my veil. Looking forward to meeting \"The Jerk Chicken Man\".   : - )","Attachments":[],"Id":1897156,"PostDate":1432517677,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm on the 6 months countdown. So it is now time to get serious about my planning. Next up, ordering wedding invitations, and purchasing my veil. Looking forward to meeting \"The Jerk Chicken Man\".   : - )\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374614124,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.87.42.110","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79199,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ee86375c518438ef6ba275e84f38eec","RawContent":"Congratulations! You will love Secrets we went a few years ago and knew it was where we wanted to get married when we got engaged! I love this resort because it is newer, you get the perks of both St. James and Wild Orchid (you can barely tell when you transition over from one side to the next). There are a ton of restaurant and bar options and no reservations which is nice (except for the hibachi restaurant). It really is a great resort! \n[quote name=\"RandL2015\" post=\"1897156\" timestamp=\"1432517677\"]\nI&#039;m on the 6 months countdown. So it is now time to get serious about my planning. Next up, ordering wedding invitations, and purchasing my veil. Looking forward to meeting \"The Jerk Chicken Man\". : - )[\/quote]\nCongratulations! The Jerk Chicken is phenomenal, I would ask my fiance to get me a water bottle and he would come back with chicken instead when we were there!","Attachments":[],"Id":1897258,"PostDate":1432652839,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations! You will love Secrets we went a few years ago and knew it was where we wanted to get married when we got engaged! I love this resort because it is newer, you get the perks of both St. James and Wild Orchid (you can barely tell when you transition over from one side to the next). There are a ton of restaurant and bar options and no reservations which is nice (except for the hibachi restaurant). It really is a great resort!\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>RandL2015, on 24 May 2015 - 05:34 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I'm on the 6 months countdown. So it is now time to get serious about my planning. Next up, ordering wedding invitations, and purchasing my veil. Looking forward to meeting \"The Jerk Chicken Man\". : - )<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congratulations! The Jerk Chicken is phenomenal, I would ask my fiance to get me a water bottle and he would come back with chicken instead when we were there!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicolechin4@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.87.42.110","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407436909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JamaicaNicole","Id":279353,"Name":"JamaicaNicole","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79199","Title":"Secrets Wild Orchid Montego Bay","LastPostDate":1432652839},"Pages":{"TotalItems":9,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
