> User 11kelsey (283274)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.158.206.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e79f39685c35ee6aeee820e5fad8d22f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1879446\" timestamp=\"1417531357\"]\nLove the lace look! I&#039;d totally do that if I wasn&#039;t wearing sandals! [img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=30126\"]ImageUploadedByTapatalk1417531349.754834.jpg[\/url]\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]I have the exact same flip flops.  I ordered them online cyber Monday.  I&#039;m quiet happy with them","Attachments":[],"Id":1879831,"PostDate":1417845732,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 02 December 2014 - 06:42 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Love the lace look! I'd totally do that if I wasn't wearing sandals! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=30126' class='bbc_url' title=''>ImageUploadedByTapatalk1417531349.754834.jpg<\/a><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I have the exact same flip flops. \u00a0I ordered them online cyber Monday. \u00a0I'm quiet happy with them\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rsfortin@telus.net","IpAddress":"75.158.192.149","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401800665,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sara1603","Id":278220,"Name":"Sara1603","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c171546c44fcda0c9c781234f5d8e238","RawContent":"[quote name=\"puravida2015\" post=\"1879829\" timestamp=\"1417845367\"]\nLove your shoes @[member=\"tygrrlily\"]!!!! Super Cute!!! I think it was your post that reminded me to try on the Landmark. Thanks!!! ;)\n\nI purchased both and had them shipped to my house so I could walk around in them for a bit to see how they feel. I didn&#039;t find the Landmarks uncomfortable as I wear similar heels pretty much everyday but I did find the strap a little loose though. And the heel actually seemed short to me, I&#039;ll want them a smidgen taller (I guess I like hooker shoes). LOL But I think the Giovanna ones are going to will work better with my dress. Still debating and on the lookout for shoes.[\/quote]\nHaha I have wide feet so I had the opposite problem - the straps were all digging into my skin making it extra painful.  If you can go higher than go higher!! I&#039;m impressed.  I always see pics of girls wearing 120mm heels and I can&#039;t even imagine that :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1879833,"PostDate":1417850320,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>puravida2015, on 05 December 2014 - 09:56 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Love your shoes\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277296\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277296-tygrrlily\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tygrrlily<\/span><\/a>!!!! Super Cute!!! I think it was your post that reminded me to try on the Landmark. Thanks!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I purchased both and had them shipped to my house so I could walk around in them for a bit to see how they feel. I didn't find the Landmarks uncomfortable as I wear similar heels pretty much everyday but I did find the strap a little loose though. And the heel actually seemed short to me, I'll want them a smidgen taller (I guess I like hooker shoes). LOL But I think the Giovanna ones are going to will work better with my dress. Still debating and on the lookout for shoes.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Haha I have wide feet so I had the opposite problem - the straps were all digging into my skin making it extra painful.\u00a0 If you can go higher than go higher!! I'm impressed.\u00a0 I always see pics of girls wearing 120mm heels and I can't even imagine that <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395609348,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f64f3bb201c943b8b64de449678465eb","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1879823\" timestamp=\"1417843768\"]\nThe ones I loved were from Aldo. Canadian store was out and USA store wouldn&#039;t ship to a USA address for me because of a Canadian credit card... Sigh! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]Don&#039;t you hate that!! What&#039;s wrong with visa here compared to visa in the US? We&#039;ve had so many issues with that over the years. We actually drove to Niagara Falls one day to go to toysrus to get a gift card to go online and buy a highchair and pack and play when my grandson was born just because we couldn&#039;t use a Canadian credit card to have it delivered to them in Pennsylvania. it&#039;s really stupid sometimes.","Attachments":[],"Id":1879836,"PostDate":1417873500,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 05 December 2014 - 09:29 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>The ones I loved were from Aldo. Canadian store was out and USA store wouldn't ship to a USA address for me because of a Canadian credit card... Sigh! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nDon't you hate that!! What's wrong with visa here compared to visa in the US? We've had so many issues with that over the years. We actually drove to Niagara Falls one day to go to toysrus to get a gift card to go online and buy a highchair and pack and play when my grandson was born just because we couldn't use a Canadian credit card to have it delivered to them in Pennsylvania. it's really stupid sometimes.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"71b29b9568cd93aa6d9383d42129b349","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1879836\" timestamp=\"1417873500\"]\nDon&#039;t you hate that!! What&#039;s wrong with visa here compared to visa in the US? We&#039;ve had so many issues with that over the years. We actually drove to Niagara Falls one day to go to toysrus to get a gift card to go online and buy a highchair and pack and play when my grandson was born just because we couldn&#039;t use a Canadian credit card to have it delivered to them in Pennsylvania. it&#039;s really stupid sometimes.[\/quote]I agree, it&#039;s ridiculous. They took pay pal but he told me that wouldn&#039;t even work. I never thought of the gift card -- good idea although it shouldn&#039;t be necessary!!! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1879839,"PostDate":1417879224,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 06 December 2014 - 05:45 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Don't you hate that!! What's wrong with visa here compared to visa in the US? We've had so many issues with that over the years. We actually drove to Niagara Falls one day to go to toysrus to get a gift card to go online and buy a highchair and pack and play when my grandson was born just because we couldn't use a Canadian credit card to have it delivered to them in Pennsylvania. it's really stupid sometimes.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI agree, it's ridiculous. They took pay pal but he told me that wouldn't even work. I never thought of the gift card -- good idea although it shouldn't be necessary!!! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.183.211.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1417888460,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"221d1cf068b9e79cdef5391e5e488a9b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1879823\" timestamp=\"1417843768\"]\nThe ones I loved were from Aldo. Canadian store was out and USA store wouldn&#039;t ship to a USA address for me because of a Canadian credit card... Sigh! \nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]That drives me crazy! I&#039;ve really realized how hard it can be to order from the USA during my wedding planning. They either don&#039;t send to Canadian address or they don&#039;t take our cards. Life can be so hard :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1879848,"PostDate":1417888434,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 05 December 2014 - 09:29 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nThe ones I loved were from Aldo. Canadian store was out and USA store wouldn't ship to a USA address for me because of a Canadian credit card... Sigh! <br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nThat drives me crazy! I've really realized how hard it can be to order from the USA during my wedding planning. They either don't send to Canadian address or they don't take our cards. Life can be so hard <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kcrosby86@msn.com","IpAddress":"142.179.243.111","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1398829631,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kayla88","Id":277780,"Name":"Kayla88","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d1a82d0fcc97eddd8cbbe8692c08f432","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Gee I don&#039;t have a picture of the shoes that I wore 3 years ago... and I have absolutely no idea what I want to wear next year!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879857,"PostDate":1417916010,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Gee I don't have a picture of the shoes that I wore 3 years ago... and I have absolutely no idea what I want to wear next year!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.91.173.42","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c64e97540810e78104fa067011cffef","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Ugghh... Nordstrom does this to me every time. My store had their private shopping event last night and I found these bad boys. I had been eyeing these for awhile but&amp;nbsp;when I saw them in person, I knew I had to have them. LOVE THEM!!!&amp;nbsp;I think these will be my shoe (until I see another one). I ended up not liking the material on the Giovanna&#039;s.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":30194,"Name":"kurtgeiger.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-279580-0-82189500-1418047874.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-279580-0-82189500-1418047874_thumb.jpg","Width":480,"Height":480}],"Id":1879920,"PostDate":1418047929,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ugghh... Nordstrom does this to me every time. My store had their private shopping event last night and I found these bad boys. I had been eyeing these for awhile but\u00a0when I saw them in person, I knew I had to have them. LOVE THEM!!!\u00a0I think these will be my shoe (until I see another one). I ended up not liking the material on the Giovanna's.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409091107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.53.250.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"33194aa8b9f2b5ab17abfff894a1e4ad","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"kcole123\"] These are GORGEOUS! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m going to be wearing barefoot sandals like these during my ceremony on the beach, but I&#039;d love to get wedges like those for more formal pictures and the reception (I could run a marathon in wedges but can&#039;t walk 5 feet in heels!)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/736x\/5f\/5f\/64\/5f5f64ce48ffdfe31a64015d0d6c8c37.jpg\" alt=\"5f5f64ce48ffdfe31a64015d0d6c8c37.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879925,"PostDate":1418049155,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277264\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277264-kcole123\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kcole123<\/span><\/a> These are GORGEOUS! \u00a0I'm going to be wearing barefoot sandals like these during my ceremony on the beach, but I'd love to get wedges like those for more formal pictures and the reception (I could run a marathon in wedges but can't walk 5 feet in heels!)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/736x\/5f\/5f\/64\/5f5f64ce48ffdfe31a64015d0d6c8c37.jpg\" alt=\"5f5f64ce48ffdfe31a64015d0d6c8c37.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachelia160@aim.com","IpAddress":"66.61.104.237","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388731897,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275855.jpg?_r=1431444128","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rachelia160","Id":275855,"Name":"rachelia160","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.91.107.221","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"953bbc3918613c2f43c208c03c804cba","RawContent":"[quote name=\"puravida2015\" post=\"1879477\" timestamp=\"1417546762\"]\nI&#039;m only 4&#039;11\" so I&#039;m going to need some height assistance from my shoes.  Right now, I&#039;m looking at both of these but I&#039;m still deciding.\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=30129\"]shoes.jpg[\/url][\/quote]I kick the ones on the left better. I love bling but id be worried that the vertical stripe on the ones on the right are too long for my foot and it would end up bunching up all night. It&#039;s probably proportional to the size of the shoe but Maybe try them on and see :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1879951,"PostDate":1418065337,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>puravida2015, on 02 December 2014 - 10:59 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I'm only 4'11\" so I'm going to need some height assistance from my shoes.  Right now, I'm looking at both of these but I'm still deciding.<br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=30129' class='bbc_url' title=''>shoes.jpg<\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI kick the ones on the left better. I love bling but id be worried that the vertical stripe on the ones on the right are too long for my foot and it would end up bunching up all night. It's probably proportional to the size of the shoe but Maybe try them on and see <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359763104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.35.35.36","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73d4c42e96475c6bd8b49113e985e406","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] - Both shoes fit fine. I purchased so I could walk around in them for a little bit and get a feel for them. But I&#039;m going to go with a different shoe.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879956,"PostDate":1418067907,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> - Both shoes fit fine. I purchased so I could walk around in them for a little bit and get a feel for them. But I'm going to go with a different shoe.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409091107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":33,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
